@lang en
IMPORT `baominh-par-fixtures`

-- Bao Minh property all risks rules: HOW MUCH IS PAYABLE.
-- Layer 2 of 3. The measure of indemnity (insuring clause, src:16-19), exclusion 9 (marine
-- excess), exclusion 10(b) (data media valuation), General Conditions 6 (contribution), 11
-- (reinstatement), 13 (deductible) and 14 (average), and the proviso's caps (cover module).
--
-- THE ORDER (NOTES.md forks F13, F14), for each item: the Damage valued at the time of the loss
-- (or the part not excluded, or the 10(b) value) -> less what the marine policy would pay
-- (exclusion 9) -> average (GC 14) -> rateable proportion (GC 6) -> what is left of the item's
-- sum insured (proviso (i)). Then for the loss: the sum of the items -> what is left of the total
-- sum insured and of each limit (proviso (i), (ii)) -> less the deductible (GC 13), which the
-- document applies "sau khi đã áp dụng tất cả các điều kiện, điều khoản" (after all the
-- conditions and terms).
--
-- The document states no figure that this module could use: every amount is the Schedule's or
-- the adjuster's, and a figure the rule needs but the record lacks is refused by name.

§ `The measure of the Damage to one item`

-- src:16 | BẢO MINH SẼ BỒI THƯỜNG CHO NGƯỜI ĐƯỢC BẢO HIỂM giá trị của tài sản tại thời điểm xảy ra
